  ],
  "question": {
    "text": "$K_1, K_2$ and $K_3$ are the equilibrium constants of the following reactions (I), (II) and (III) respectively:\n(I) $\\mathrm{N}_2+2 \\mathrm{O}_2 \\rightleftharpoons 2 \\mathrm{NO}_2$\n(II) $2 \\mathrm{NO}_2 \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{N}_2+2 \\mathrm{O}_2$\n(III) $\\mathrm{NO}_2 \\rightleftharpoons \\frac{1}{2} \\mathrm{~N}_2+\\mathrm{O}_2$\nThe correct relation from the following is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "vjt91",
      "text": "\n$K_1=\\frac{1}{K_2}=\\frac{1}{K_3}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "9p3aE",
      "text": "\n$K_1=\\frac{1}{K_2}=\\frac{1}{\\left(K_3\\right)^2}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "i5Tw3",
      "text": "\n$K_1=\\sqrt{K_2}=K_3$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "4OyK9",
      "text": "\n$K_1=\\frac{1}{K_2}=K_3$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "(I) $\\mathrm{N}_2+2 \\mathrm{O}_2 \\stackrel{K_1}{\\rightleftharpoons} 2 \\mathrm{NO}_2$\n$$\nK_1=\\frac{\\left[\\mathrm{NO}_2\\right]^2}{\\left[\\mathrm{~N}_2\\right]\\left[\\mathrm{O}_2\\right]^2}\n$$\n(II) $2 \\mathrm{NO}_2 \\underset{K_2}{\\rightleftharpoons} \\mathrm{N}_2+2 \\mathrm{O}_2$\n$$\nK_2=\\frac{\\left[\\mathrm{N}_2\\right]\\left[\\mathrm{O}_2\\right]^2}{\\left[\\mathrm{NO}_2\\right]^2}\n$$\n(III)\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{NO}_2 \\underset{K_3}{\\rightleftharpoons} \\frac{1}{2} \\mathrm{~N}_2+\\mathrm{O}_2 \\\\\n& K_3=\\frac{\\left[\\mathrm{N}_2\\right]^{1 / 2}\\left[\\mathrm{O}_2\\right]}{\\left[\\mathrm{NO}_2\\right]} \\\\\n& \\therefore\\left(K_3\\right)^2=\\frac{\\left[\\mathrm{N}_2\\right]\\left[\\mathrm{O}_2\\right]^2}{\\left[\\mathrm{NO}_2\\right]^2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n$\\therefore$ from equation (i), (ii) and (iii)\n$$\nK_1=\\frac{1}{K_2}=\\frac{1}{\\left(K_3\\right)^2}\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
